sequenceDiagram
    participant F as flushImmutable
    participant M as manifest
    participant WS as wal.flush
    participant W as WAL

    F->>M: AppendNewFile (durable SST)
    F->>WS: write FreezeOffset + SSTID (.tmp → rename, fsync)
    Note over WS: crash window: SST durable, WAL still full
    F->>W: Sync original file
    F->>W: copy tail to wal.truncate.tmp
    F->>W: fsync tmp, close handles
    F->>W: atomic rename replaces wal.log
    F->>WS: remove wal.flush
    Note over W: crash after truncate: replay from 0 if size < FreezeOffset
